{coverage}

## 2. Scope and method

{sources}

Two passes: (1) deterministic rules over citation entries and numbering, numeric/percentage consistency, statistical reporting, method design, argument chain and academic norms; (2) a citation-support matrix pairing each claim sentence with its cited entry, leaving support verdicts explicitly open. No external database was queried; anything about the content or publication status of cited works stays in pending human review.

## 3. Findings

{findings}

## 4. Citation-support matrix (verdicts open)

{pairs} claim-citation pairs. verdict in full/partial/none/undetermined must be decided against the cited source; nothing is presupposed.

